# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Spike outputs and macOS cruft
spikes/spike-out/
spike-out/
.DS_Store

# Test and spike output, scratch media (design/ assets and tests/golden PNGs are tracked on purpose)
*.cmrec/
*.cmshot/
spikes/**/*.mp4
spikes/**/*.wav
spike-out/**/*.mp4
spike-out/**/*.wav
/scripts_tmp
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
packaging/ffmpeg/out/
packaging/ffmpeg/out-x86_64/
packaging/ffmpeg/.downloads/
packaging/llama/out/
packaging/llama/out-x86_64/
packaging/llama/.downloads/
packaging/sherpa/out/
packaging/sherpa/out-x86_64/
packaging/sherpa/.downloads/

# Local-only: agent settings and worktrees
.claude/

# Working material kept locally, not published: design-tool sources, agent status reports,
# surveys and frame captures of verification runs
design/redesign/source/
design/**/STATUS*.md
design/i18n-STATUS*.md
design/openh264-removal-STATUS.md
specs/icon-inventory.md
verification/*-frames/
# Design mockups (HTML and PNG boards) and the redesign working notes: kept locally, not published.
# The kit that the build reads stays tracked: design/tokens, design/icons, design/brand, design/fonts.
design/redesign/
design/screens/
specs/redesign-plan.md
specs/redesign-gaps.md

# Design kit drops (HTML/PNG boards): local only
capturemann-redesign*/
capturemann-icons*/

# Website copy review notes (owner reads it, not published)
website-copy-review.md
